title: "CHerakoi"
type: software
description: "Pure-frontend (vanilla HTML/CSS/JS) sonification of XRF cubes (HDF5/.npz): spatial map + per-pixel spectrum mapped to audio, with MediaPipe hand tracking or mouse test mode."
